# capabilities

The typed GraphLaw capability surface, generated from the capability registry
`{{ registry[0].schema_id }}`.

- GraphLaw release: `{{ registry[0].graphlaw_version }}` (ABI `{{ registry[0].abi_version }}`).
- Capabilities: {{ registry[0].op_count }}. Dialects: {{ registry[0].dialect_count }}.
